@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam BorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B6A16C
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
title UC-02  Student learning
' Requirements: PERM-01 PROFILE-01 PROFILE-02 ASSESS-01 ASSESS-02 ASSESS-03 ASSESS-04 ASSESS-05 CONTENT-03 CONTENT-06 CONTENT-07 DISC-01 DISC-02 DISC-03 DISC-04 QUIZ-01 QUIZ-02 QUIZ-03 QUIZ-04 QUIZ-05 QUIZ-06 QUIZ-07 QUIZ-08 PROGRESS-01 PROGRESS-02 PROGRESS-03 REWARD-01 REWARD-02 DATA-01 P-02 P-03 P-04 P-05 P-06
left to right direction
actor "Student" as A
rectangle "CS-GAMUERS: learning" {
  usecase "Edit learning profile" as U0
  usecase "Take optional skills assessment" as U1
  usecase "Search and filter courses" as U2
  usecase "View course details\nand start or resume a course" as U3
  usecase "Study lessons and resources" as U4
  usecase "Take or retake course quizzes" as U5
  usecase "View progress and earned badges" as U6
}
A -- U0
A -- U1
A -- U2
A -- U3
A -- U4
A -- U5
A -- U6
note bottom of A
Approved, active Student account required.
Prerequisites and lesson order are advisory.
Course completion requires all required quizzes.
Only course completion earns a badge.
Assessment is optional and has no pass/fail.
end note
footer CS-GAMUERS | UC-02 | Product behavior
@enduml
